    "markdown": "---\njupyter: python3\ntitle: \"Skill Gap Analysis\"\n---\n\n## Team Skills vs. Market Demand (Data Scientist Postings, NAICS 5417)\n\nThis page compares our team's self-rated skills with the skills most often requested in the 760 Data Scientist postings from the Market Baseline (January to August 2026).\n\n### Market demand from job postings\n\n::: {#a34f1dfc .cell execution_count=1}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nimport pandas as pd\nimport plotly.express as px\nfrom IPython.display import Markdown, display\nimport theme  # applies the \"course\" Plotly template\n\njobs = pd.read_csv(\"output/career_market_panel.csv\")\n\nskill_cols = [\"skills_array\", \"specialized_skills_array\",\n              \"common_skills_array\", \"software_skills_array\"]\ntext = jobs[skill_cols].fillna(\"\").astype(str).agg(\" \".join, axis=1)\n\n# display name -> search pattern in the skills text\npatterns = {\n    \"Python\": r\"Python\",\n    \"SQL\": r\"\\bSQL\\b\",\n    \"Machine Learning\": r\"Machine Learning\",\n    \"Deep Learning\": r\"Deep Learning\",\n    \"TensorFlow\": r\"TensorFlow\",\n    \"Data Pipelines\": r\"Data Pipeline|\\bETL\\b|Extract Transform Load\",\n    \"Cloud (AWS/Azure/GCP)\": r\"Amazon Web Services|\\bAWS\\b|Azure|Google Cloud|\\bGCP\\b\",\n    \"Statistics\": r\"Statistic\",\n    \"Tableau\": r\"Tableau\",\n    \"Power BI\": r\"Power BI\",\n    \"Databricks\": r\"Databricks\",\n    \"Kubernetes\": r\"Kubernetes\",\n}\n\ndemand = pd.Series({\n    name: text.str.contains(pat, case=False, regex=True).mean()\n    for name, pat in patterns.items()\n}).sort_values(ascending=False)\n\ndemand_pct = (demand * 100).round(1)\nprint(f\"Share of all {len(jobs)} postings that list each skill\")\ndemand_pct.rename(\"% of postings listing skill\").to_frame()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n```\nShare of all 760 postings that list each skill\n```\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<style scoped>\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n</style>\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th></th>\n      <th>% of postings listing skill</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Python</th>\n      <td>55.0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Machine Learning</th>\n      <td>44.6</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>SQL</th>\n      <td>27.1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>TensorFlow</th>\n      <td>12.5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Statistics</th>\n      <td>11.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Deep Learning</th>\n      <td>9.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Data Pipelines</th>\n      <td>8.8</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Tableau</th>\n      <td>6.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Databricks</th>\n      <td>5.1</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Kubernetes</th>\n      <td>5.0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Power BI</th>\n      <td>4.9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Cloud (AWS/Azure/GCP)</th>\n      <td>4.2</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {#3ccd21fa .cell execution_count=2}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nplot_df = demand_pct.sort_values().rename_axis(\"Skill\").reset_index(name=\"Pct\")\nfig = px.bar(plot_df, x=\"Pct\", y=\"Skill\", orientation=\"h\",\n             title=\"Most In-Demand Skills in Data Scientist Postings\")\nfig.update_xaxes(title=\"% of postings listing the skill\")\nfig.update_yaxes(title=\"\")\nfig.show()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<div style=\"height:525px; width:100%;\">            <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-svg.min.js\"></script><script>if (window.MathJax && window.MathJax.Hub && window.MathJax.Hub.Config) {window.MathJax.Hub.